WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:44.000
FANGHUA PALACE

01:44.080 --> 01:45.400
BROTHER

01:56.120 --> 01:57.440
I am so useless.

01:57.520 --> 02:00.720
I promised my brother I'd protect Mei Lin.

02:01.480 --> 02:03.480
Your Highness, this is not your fault.

02:03.560 --> 02:06.440
She insisted on leaving.
How could we stop her?

02:08.280 --> 02:10.960
But General Yin said Prince Jing took her.

02:12.600 --> 02:13.480
Chagu,

02:14.240 --> 02:16.760
what if Mei Lin got eaten by a black bear?

02:16.840 --> 02:18.080
Your Highness,

02:18.160 --> 02:20.280
His Majesty has already
sent people to search for her.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.440
Maybe she's still alive.

02:22.080 --> 02:24.360
Mei Lin doesn't seem
like an ordinary girl.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.840
She won't get killed so easily.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.360
Right.

02:30.440 --> 02:33.080
She's just missing. She's not dead.

02:39.160 --> 02:40.000
No,

02:40.680 --> 02:42.520
I can't tell my brother.

02:44.280 --> 02:47.760
He's having a hard time in Xiyan too.
I can't make him worry.

02:50.320 --> 02:51.360
Chagu,

02:52.000 --> 02:54.320
His Majesty will find
Mei Lin alive, right?

03:08.800 --> 03:10.840
Your Majesty, please take your medicine.

03:15.040 --> 03:16.120
Has the search started?

03:21.800 --> 03:22.640
Remember,

03:23.800 --> 03:25.160
search for her under Concubine Yan's name.

03:25.960 --> 03:28.800
Once Mei Lin is found,
I want to be the first to question her.

03:29.800 --> 03:31.320
Keep this from Concubine Yan.

03:32.040 --> 03:34.320
Your Majesty, do you suspect Mei Lin?

03:36.160 --> 03:38.120
With secret guards around Jinghe,

03:39.080 --> 03:40.920
this accident seems suspicious.

03:42.080 --> 03:44.200
Many from Qingzhou
have always resented the court,

03:45.240 --> 03:47.200
and Mei Lin is an orphan from there.

03:48.040 --> 03:51.200
I'm worried she has other plans.

03:52.920 --> 03:55.120
In any case, I want her found,

03:55.800 --> 03:57.040
alive…

03:58.200 --> 03:59.600
or dead.

04:00.800 --> 04:01.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

04:04.320 --> 04:05.600
How are the preparations…

04:09.160 --> 04:10.720
for Jinghe's funeral coming along?

04:11.800 --> 04:13.280
According to your instructions,

04:13.360 --> 04:15.200
everything is being handled
as a state funeral.

04:15.800 --> 04:18.959
His Highness has taken care of it all.

04:40.360 --> 04:44.920
MEMORIAL TABLET OF PRINCE MURONG JINGHE

04:45.000 --> 04:46.160
Kneel!

04:46.240 --> 04:50.720
TINGYUN PAVILION

04:50.800 --> 04:52.120
Prostrate!

05:06.840 --> 05:09.520
Return to the capital immediately
and prepare for my funeral.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.880
For my safety, make it convincing.

05:11.960 --> 05:13.080
Rise!

05:13.160 --> 05:17.200
TINGYUN PAVILION

05:21.080 --> 05:22.760
Your Highness,
we've been watching for days.

05:22.840 --> 05:25.480
Qingyan hasn't sent anyone
to look for his master.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.040
Could Prince Jing really be dead?

05:27.120 --> 05:28.920
The two of them always put on a show.

05:29.520 --> 05:32.080
In any case, I must see
Jinghe's body myself.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.040
Send more men to search,

05:33.760 --> 05:36.840
claiming the target is Mei Lin,
Jinghe's greatest love,

05:36.920 --> 05:38.200
to avoid raising Father's suspicions.

05:38.280 --> 05:39.120
Understood.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.880
By the way, where is General Yin?

05:42.800 --> 05:45.440
Of all the officials, only General Yin
hasn't paid respects

05:46.840 --> 05:48.960
or sent offerings.

05:51.240 --> 05:54.560
It seems she hasn't accepted
Jinghe's death.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.560
You've caught a chill.

06:08.160 --> 06:10.560
Go home and brew some Tianjing Grass soup.

06:10.640 --> 06:11.480
Got it.

06:16.640 --> 06:18.800
Sir, could you take a look at her?

06:20.320 --> 06:21.440
You're awake, young lady?

06:22.120 --> 06:23.680
I told you she'd be fine,

06:23.760 --> 06:24.880
but you didn't believe me.

06:24.960 --> 06:28.120
Honestly, she looks better than you.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.800
Give her Tianjing Grass
for quicker recovery.

06:30.880 --> 06:31.920
Sir,

06:33.120 --> 06:35.160
please check on my brother too.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.760
I don't need checking.

06:39.920 --> 06:42.640
Your brother is quite weak.

06:43.280 --> 06:44.520
He needs proper rest and care.

06:45.240 --> 06:48.560
You should have some Tianjing Grass too.

06:48.640 --> 06:50.680
Is this Tianjing Grass a cure-all?

06:51.440 --> 06:53.320
You outlanders don't understand.

06:53.400 --> 06:55.520
Tianjing Grass boosts energy,
enhances circulation,

06:55.600 --> 06:56.960
and keeps people and livestock healthy.

06:58.200 --> 07:00.320
I'm better at medicine than he is.

07:00.400 --> 07:01.560
If you're unwell,

07:01.640 --> 07:04.280
let me treat you.
Luckily, Qingyan left me some medicine.

07:04.360 --> 07:05.600
Since when did you become a physician?

07:06.120 --> 07:07.560
- Illness makes one a doctor.
- Futian's father!

07:07.640 --> 07:09.120
Hurry! Save him!

07:09.200 --> 07:10.080
Wei is dying!

07:11.280 --> 07:13.360
- Hurry.
- Be careful.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.120
When did he get sick?

07:16.200 --> 07:17.720
We were hunting in the mountains

07:17.800 --> 07:19.000
and found him unconscious by the stream.

07:19.080 --> 07:20.320
He…

07:20.400 --> 07:22.080
He looks like he has the plague.

07:23.200 --> 07:24.240
The mountain stream?

07:24.320 --> 07:25.720
It's by the path near Sunset Cliff.

07:26.240 --> 07:27.600
Is the stream water contaminated?

07:28.200 --> 07:30.360
Hurry! Tie up these two outlanders!

07:30.440 --> 07:31.680
They're carrying the plague!

07:31.760 --> 07:34.960
Everyone who got sick
was infected by them!

07:45.800 --> 07:47.920
They were poisoned from drinking
the mountain stream water?

07:49.800 --> 07:51.200
Wei is in critical condition.

07:51.280 --> 07:52.600
He may not survive without an antidote.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.560
This poison, developed by the Xiyan,

07:56.240 --> 07:58.120
was used to contaminate upstream water

07:58.200 --> 07:59.600
and kill many Yan soldiers.

08:00.920 --> 08:04.840
I never thought the Crown Prince
would scapegoat the Xiyan.

08:05.440 --> 08:06.560
Can we save him?

08:07.680 --> 08:10.360
Thunder Duke Vine and Qingyan's medicine
can neutralize the poison.

08:11.240 --> 08:13.040
There's Thunder Duke Vine in the mountain.

08:20.680 --> 08:21.520
Wait until nightfall.

08:21.600 --> 08:23.280
If we leave now,
we won't have an explanation.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.360
Alright.

08:31.360 --> 08:33.159
What about the other villagers?

08:34.360 --> 08:37.000
The mountain stream water
reaching the village is much less toxic.

08:37.520 --> 08:38.440
They should be fine.

08:40.360 --> 08:42.880
It's always like this.
The common folk, clueless as ever,

08:42.960 --> 08:44.120
always get caught in the crossfire.

08:44.960 --> 08:47.400
They went into hiding to escape disaster,

08:48.000 --> 08:49.280
yet still, disaster found them.

08:59.120 --> 09:00.040
There's a fire.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.080
There's a fire.

09:05.320 --> 09:07.440
Mei Lin! Our house is on fire!

09:12.440 --> 09:13.320
We need to go.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.320
- Let's go!
- Mei Lin…

09:16.760 --> 09:18.080
Come on!

09:18.880 --> 09:20.840
They jumped out the window! Help!

09:22.160 --> 09:24.120
Stop running! You two, stop!

09:24.200 --> 09:25.880
- Stop right there!
- Stop!

09:26.720 --> 09:27.760
Why are you running?

09:27.840 --> 09:29.200
You're infected with the plague,

09:29.280 --> 09:31.320
so we're burning herbs to ward it off.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.680
If you don't get treated,
you'll endanger yourselves and others!

09:33.760 --> 09:35.000
We can't let you spread it!

09:35.080 --> 09:36.040
Exactly! You can't leave!

09:36.640 --> 09:38.600
Listen to me.
My sister and I aren't infected.

09:38.680 --> 09:41.480
Wei and the villagers got sick
from the mountain stream water.

09:41.560 --> 09:42.400
I know how to cure them.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.720
Are you a physician?

09:45.880 --> 09:48.720
My sister and I caught the same illness
while we were fleeing.

09:48.800 --> 09:50.920
A traveling physician saved us
with Thunder Duke Vine.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.840
I'm sure it can save them too.

09:53.400 --> 09:55.360
- Can Thunder Duke Vine work?
- Why…

09:55.440 --> 09:57.160
Why should we believe you?

09:57.240 --> 09:58.800
I can go up the mountain
to gather the herbs.

09:59.960 --> 10:01.120
I'll go with you.

10:01.760 --> 10:02.840
Let your sister go.

10:02.920 --> 10:04.320
You're too weak. Stay here as a hostage.

10:04.920 --> 10:06.160
I'll go with them.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.440
- Let's go.
- Alright, this way.

10:08.520 --> 10:10.240
- Come on.
- Let's go gather the herbs. Let's go.

10:12.560 --> 10:15.920
WEST SUBURBS BARRACKS

10:50.600 --> 10:52.240
Luomei, remember,

10:52.320 --> 10:53.400
protect the nation.

10:56.800 --> 10:58.080
And keep Great Yan safe!

11:10.520 --> 11:11.680
Your Highness.

11:20.520 --> 11:22.840
General Yin, I'll practice with you.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.080
I've lost.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.480
If we were on the battlefield,

11:42.080 --> 11:43.120
my dagger slipping

11:43.880 --> 11:45.560
would have meant death by your sword.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.200
Longer weapons have the advantage.

11:50.800 --> 11:51.960
I fought your short dagger
with my long sword.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.000
My victory has no honor.

12:00.920 --> 12:02.240
A defeat is a defeat.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.160
Everything is already decided.

12:09.000 --> 12:11.480
Indeed. Everything is already decided.

12:13.160 --> 12:14.000
Luomei,

12:14.800 --> 12:15.640
these past years,

12:16.200 --> 12:18.080
Jinghe didn't have it easy.

12:18.960 --> 12:22.040
He wanted to be buried in Qingzhou
with the Weibei Army.

12:22.120 --> 12:24.760
Perhaps this way

12:24.840 --> 12:26.360
is a release for him.

12:28.680 --> 12:30.040
I'm just sad

12:31.120 --> 12:32.960
Prince Jing didn't die on the battlefield.

12:40.160 --> 12:41.000
Forget it.

12:41.840 --> 12:44.600
Let this dagger be buried with him.

13:08.160 --> 13:10.960
That dagger was actually a gift from me.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.520
It pairs with this one.

13:23.160 --> 13:24.000
When we were younger,

13:24.080 --> 13:26.720
I knew of your feelings for him
and didn't dare compete,

13:27.520 --> 13:29.800
so I gave it to you through him.

13:31.520 --> 13:33.160
I never thought I'd get to say this

13:33.240 --> 13:36.480
or that these two daggers would reunite.

13:42.920 --> 13:43.760
Luomei,

13:46.440 --> 13:47.280
in fact,

13:48.120 --> 13:48.960
it's not just Jinghe

13:49.960 --> 13:51.720
who can fight by your side. I can too.

13:52.440 --> 13:54.080
I can stand with you
through life and death.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.240
Will you

13:58.000 --> 13:59.240
keep this dagger for my sake?

14:00.280 --> 14:03.640
I've already decided
to bury it with Prince Jing.

14:15.680 --> 14:17.240
Though it was a gift from Your Highness,

14:17.880 --> 14:18.960
it holds

14:19.960 --> 14:22.200
many memories of my time with him.

14:23.880 --> 14:27.360
Let it carry those memories
and be buried with him.

14:30.160 --> 14:31.280
I hope Prince Jing

14:32.120 --> 14:34.520
can once again be
a great general in his next life.

14:41.920 --> 14:42.800
Strike the drums for the general

14:45.280 --> 14:48.280
and send his heroic soul off to battle!

15:15.240 --> 15:16.080
Luomei,

15:17.200 --> 15:21.040
I hope this is the last time
you grieve for him.

15:29.320 --> 15:31.640
Farewell, General!

15:32.520 --> 15:34.800
Farewell, General!

16:28.760 --> 16:30.040
Why aren't they back yet?

16:30.120 --> 16:31.480
They've been gone too long.

16:31.560 --> 16:33.200
Is that them over there?

16:33.280 --> 16:34.520
Why aren't they back yet?

16:34.600 --> 16:35.440
I don't know.

16:38.360 --> 16:39.600
It really is them!

16:39.680 --> 16:40.920
They're back!

16:41.000 --> 16:42.160
They're back!

16:42.240 --> 16:43.080
We found it.

16:44.440 --> 16:45.280
Here.

16:47.400 --> 16:49.480
Boil the Thunder Duke Vine
with this medicine.

16:49.560 --> 16:51.000
It'll work faster.

16:51.080 --> 16:52.400
Come on. Let's get to it.

16:52.920 --> 16:54.400
- Right.
- Let's go.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.880
That's his sleeping powder.

17:23.520 --> 17:24.839
It really worked!

17:24.920 --> 17:26.839
- Thank you so much, miss!
- What a relief.

17:27.359 --> 17:28.600
Thank you.

17:30.600 --> 17:31.840
Futian's father.

17:31.920 --> 17:33.080
What happened to me?

17:33.160 --> 17:34.440
You were poisoned.

17:34.520 --> 17:36.240
They saved you.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.640
Thank you, miss.

17:53.320 --> 17:55.600
Avoid heavy labor for the next few days.

17:55.680 --> 17:58.080
Madam Wang, we'll head back now.

17:58.160 --> 17:59.280
Alright.

18:06.920 --> 18:07.880
Who are they?

18:09.160 --> 18:11.080
They're siblings who fled to our village.

18:12.920 --> 18:16.360
They're really kind, especially the girl.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.520
You've got your eye on her, haven't you?

18:19.600 --> 18:20.640
No, I haven't.

18:21.560 --> 18:23.840
No? Who would believe that?

18:49.640 --> 18:50.960
Miss Mei Lin!

18:52.120 --> 18:54.120
- Miss Mei Lin.
- Madam.

18:54.200 --> 18:56.760
There's something I'd like to ask you.

18:57.360 --> 18:58.280
Are you engaged?

18:58.360 --> 18:59.600
- No.
- Yes.

19:04.160 --> 19:05.640
She was engaged,

19:05.720 --> 19:07.680
but her fiance

19:07.760 --> 19:09.520
died while we were fleeing.

19:09.600 --> 19:11.640
Now, it's just the two of us.

19:11.720 --> 19:13.480
After all this time, as her brother,

19:15.000 --> 19:16.360
I'm reluctant to let her go.

19:17.480 --> 19:20.320
All women eventually marry, right?

19:20.400 --> 19:22.480
You wouldn't want
to hold your sister back.

19:23.560 --> 19:24.520
Miss Mei Lin,

19:24.600 --> 19:26.240
there are plenty of good men
in our village.

19:26.320 --> 19:27.680
Take your time to pick.

19:27.760 --> 19:30.320
I'm sure both you and your brother
will be satisfied.

19:32.320 --> 19:33.160
It's up to my brother.

19:34.920 --> 19:37.600
Madam Wang, here's the thing.
Once Mei Lin gets better,

19:37.680 --> 19:39.760
we'll be on the road
to find our relatives.

19:40.360 --> 19:42.120
It's dangerous out there.

19:42.200 --> 19:44.680
Why don't you stay here?

19:44.760 --> 19:47.520
Laowozi Village is safe from war

19:47.600 --> 19:48.760
and government interference,

19:48.840 --> 19:50.720
with plenty of mountains and streams
to keep you fed.

19:50.800 --> 19:53.120
If you stay, you'll have a good life.

19:54.840 --> 19:56.960
Think it over.

19:57.040 --> 19:58.600
We'll think about it.

19:58.680 --> 20:00.040
Think it over, okay?

20:00.600 --> 20:01.640
Madam,

20:02.480 --> 20:03.560
I'm the one who makes the call.

20:05.000 --> 20:07.280
Right, my brother makes the call.

20:09.520 --> 20:11.920
Alright then.
I'll go get a bed ready for you two.

20:12.880 --> 20:13.720
A bed?

20:15.280 --> 20:17.200
Oh, right. You're siblings,

20:17.280 --> 20:19.120
so you can't share the same bed.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.600
I'll prepare two beds.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.080
Two.

20:26.840 --> 20:28.240
Do I really get to make the call?

20:29.400 --> 20:31.200
I'm not as good at making up stories,

20:31.280 --> 20:32.600
so you decide.

20:37.280 --> 20:39.360
If only you'd always listen to me.

20:43.160 --> 20:44.000
Come with me.

20:44.080 --> 20:46.160
- Where?
- You'll see when we get there.

21:02.600 --> 21:04.640
I saw them while gathering herbs
in the mountains.

21:06.080 --> 21:06.920
You brought me here

21:08.160 --> 21:09.120
to watch fireflies with you?

21:10.400 --> 21:11.440
We're here to catch them,

21:12.280 --> 21:13.120
not just watch.

21:40.440 --> 21:41.560
You don't know how to catch fireflies?

22:13.440 --> 22:14.600
Don't move.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.640
You like fireflies?

22:42.480 --> 22:44.720
Don't you like sleeping with the light on?

22:46.320 --> 22:48.520
The villagers don't
want to waste lamp oil,

22:49.640 --> 22:51.920
so you can hang
this firefly pouch by your bed.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.360
It might help you sleep.

22:55.280 --> 22:56.360
Why are you doing this?

22:58.160 --> 22:59.960
You gave your sleeping powder
to the villagers.

23:00.560 --> 23:02.360
Without it, you can't sleep.

23:02.960 --> 23:04.280
I can't knock you out every night, right?

23:06.560 --> 23:08.040
I'm the reason they suffer.

23:09.160 --> 23:10.600
I deserve the consequences.

23:17.720 --> 23:18.680
Hurt your hand breaking the window?

23:20.720 --> 23:22.000
Let's go home and treat it.

23:22.920 --> 23:24.440
It's just a scratch. Don't worry about it.

23:26.480 --> 23:28.480
For a moment, I thought
they were going to…

23:31.760 --> 23:33.320
Why were you so panicked today?

23:33.920 --> 23:36.920
You weren't scared at all
when Wenhua Pavilion caught fire.

23:37.000 --> 23:38.520
I was afraid you'd end up like my father.

23:39.960 --> 23:41.560
During the Qingzhou fire,

23:41.640 --> 23:43.560
he saved me at the cost of his life.

23:45.280 --> 23:48.680
I watched as he was burned alive
but he never let go of the rope.

23:48.760 --> 23:49.880
Mei, hold on tight!

23:52.400 --> 23:54.000
- Father!
- Mei!

23:56.080 --> 23:57.480
- Father!
- You must…

23:57.560 --> 24:00.400
You must survive!

24:02.520 --> 24:03.880
I used to struggle with sleep.

24:05.040 --> 24:08.080
Even a sliver of light
would give me nightmares.

24:11.000 --> 24:13.280
But now, I don't anymore.

24:17.800 --> 24:20.520
Both the Qingzhou fire
and Zhongshan poisoning

24:21.200 --> 24:25.120
resulted from the power struggle
for the throne.

24:26.160 --> 24:27.920
You, Wei,

24:28.960 --> 24:29.920
the Xiyan Beauties,

24:30.600 --> 24:32.360
and the 100,000 innocent people

24:33.120 --> 24:35.360
don't deserve any of these consequences.

24:38.280 --> 24:41.360
I once valued the honor
of the Weibei Army above all,

24:42.320 --> 24:43.320
but now, I realize

24:44.080 --> 24:45.600
the suffering of the people

24:45.680 --> 24:47.520
far exceeds anything
the Weibei Army went through.

24:49.080 --> 24:50.440
What's done is done.

24:51.240 --> 24:52.400
We have to look ahead.

24:55.280 --> 24:57.920
We both need to learn
to wake up from our nightmares.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.480
Let's go.

25:21.480 --> 25:22.680
It makes the room much brighter.

25:24.880 --> 25:26.120
Sleep well.

25:38.040 --> 25:40.280
Even a lifetime of atonement

25:41.200 --> 25:42.960
may never be enough.

25:54.720 --> 25:55.960
What?

25:57.720 --> 25:59.240
The Crown Prince

26:00.480 --> 26:02.560
is also searching for Mei Lin?

26:02.640 --> 26:05.880
His Highness often says in private

26:05.960 --> 26:07.360
that he doesn't believe

26:08.200 --> 26:09.440
Prince Jing's death

26:10.280 --> 26:11.800
was an accident.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.120
Liu Zhong,

26:15.400 --> 26:16.640
what do you think?

26:20.360 --> 26:21.800
Speak freely.

26:22.760 --> 26:23.600
Your Majesty,

26:24.720 --> 26:26.000
in my humble opinion,

26:26.080 --> 26:28.600
His Highness and Your Majesty

26:28.680 --> 26:30.400
are thinking the same thing.

26:31.360 --> 26:34.160
Both General Yin
and Princess Hengyang's son

26:34.240 --> 26:38.040
saw Mei Lin at Lushan Hunting Ground.

26:39.080 --> 26:42.280
I'm afraid the truth
behind Prince Jing's death

26:42.360 --> 26:46.200
can only be uncovered
when we find Mei Lin.

26:47.800 --> 26:50.320
You sly old fox,
you're just circling around!

26:56.560 --> 26:58.000
Send some Imperial Guards

26:58.080 --> 26:59.720
to secretly follow the Crown Prince's men.

27:00.360 --> 27:02.400
We must find Mei Lin

27:03.120 --> 27:04.160
before they do.

27:05.920 --> 27:07.400
Your Majesty, do you mean…?

27:08.440 --> 27:11.000
I suspect the Crown Prince
is searching for Mei Lin

27:12.560 --> 27:14.440
to kill her.

27:15.760 --> 27:16.600
Your Majesty,

27:17.480 --> 27:20.720
are you implying that His Highness

27:20.800 --> 27:22.960
was behind Prince Jing's death?

27:34.080 --> 27:34.920
Liu Zhong,

27:37.400 --> 27:39.360
do you think it's my bad karma

27:41.320 --> 27:42.760
that my sons

27:44.640 --> 27:47.000
have come to this?

27:48.640 --> 27:49.520
Your Majesty,

27:50.680 --> 27:53.120
Prince Jing is already gone.

27:53.200 --> 27:55.320
Even if you uncover the truth,

27:55.400 --> 27:57.040
what good would it do?

27:59.400 --> 28:00.240
Jinghe,

28:03.120 --> 28:04.040
Empress Dejia,

28:07.520 --> 28:09.200
don't blame me.

28:11.520 --> 28:13.080
Born into the imperial family,

28:14.920 --> 28:17.080
this is his fate.

28:21.240 --> 28:23.240
I've walked this same path myself.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.320
As long as the Crown Prince

28:29.080 --> 28:31.360
doesn't jeopardize the nation,

28:33.400 --> 28:35.760
I cannot strip him of his position.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.360
But I must

28:39.040 --> 28:41.680
know the truth!

28:43.360 --> 28:45.960
Your Highness? What brings you here?

28:46.040 --> 28:47.080
Where is everyone?

28:47.160 --> 28:48.680
Why didn't you report
Her Highness's arrival?

28:50.240 --> 28:51.120
I acknowledge my mistake.

28:51.200 --> 28:53.360
I… I've overstepped my bounds.

28:54.240 --> 28:57.200
I just wanted to bring some
ginseng soup to Your Majesty.

29:10.760 --> 29:12.280
The filth and gossip in the palace

29:13.320 --> 29:14.320
are none of your concern.

29:15.800 --> 29:16.640
Don't listen to it,

29:17.240 --> 29:18.680
and don't overthink things.

29:21.720 --> 29:24.160
Yes, I understand.

29:32.320 --> 29:33.160
- Liu Zhong.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

29:33.240 --> 29:35.160
- Where's the burn ointment?
- I'll fetch it right away.

29:41.600 --> 29:43.120
I know you're worried about Mei Lin.

29:44.080 --> 29:45.360
I've already sent people
to search for her.

29:47.080 --> 29:49.040
If she had nothing to do
with Jinghe's death,

29:49.120 --> 29:50.760
I wouldn't harm her.

29:51.360 --> 29:52.640
But if she was involved,

29:54.000 --> 29:55.680
I don't want you to interfere.

29:56.640 --> 29:57.720
Do you understand?

29:59.720 --> 30:00.840
Yes.

30:02.000 --> 30:03.200
Your Majesty.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.720
Did I scare you?

30:14.720 --> 30:16.200
Next time I'm angry,

30:17.280 --> 30:20.240
stay away from me.

30:25.080 --> 30:26.800
We might receive good news

30:28.240 --> 30:30.400
from your brother in Xiyan soon.

30:37.120 --> 30:38.160
No need to be scared.

30:40.480 --> 30:41.600
Go back and rest.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

31:16.360 --> 31:18.560
Under the divine envoys' watch,

31:18.640 --> 31:20.320
His Majesty fulfills heaven's will,

31:20.400 --> 31:22.760
blessing Xiyan with peace, prosperity,
and abundant resources

31:22.840 --> 31:24.600
through all seasons.

31:24.680 --> 31:27.480
The people of Xiyan give thanks
to the heavens and honor our King!

31:36.400 --> 31:37.240
Rise.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.720
The gods revealed in a dream
to His Majesty

31:42.800 --> 31:46.240
that the Left Divine Envoy, Sun Kunlun,
was born into the royal family of Xiyan.

31:46.320 --> 31:48.320
Today, we have the Second Prince, Yue Chu,

31:48.400 --> 31:51.400
and the Sixth Prince, Yue Qin,
both wise and brave.

31:52.080 --> 31:54.760
We beseech the gods for a clear sign
to appoint the rightful heir

31:54.840 --> 31:57.120
and bless Xiyan
for a thousand generations!

32:33.440 --> 32:35.440
I have seen the will of the gods.

32:36.080 --> 32:38.440
You are the chosen one.

32:41.320 --> 32:43.200
The Second Prince tampered with the altar.

32:44.880 --> 32:46.360
I will set everything back

32:46.440 --> 32:48.080
on the right track.

33:11.720 --> 33:13.160
MINGJU, GENERAL OF XIYAN

33:18.120 --> 33:19.480
It seems the Sixth Prince

33:19.560 --> 33:21.600
is the reincarnation of the Sun Kunlun!

33:22.120 --> 33:23.480
You…!

33:25.520 --> 33:27.520
Father, the High Priest and Yue Qin
are colluding.

33:27.600 --> 33:29.200
They've tricked you!

33:29.760 --> 33:33.000
Father, I would never dare
interfere with divine will.

33:33.600 --> 33:34.840
The Second Prince
disrespects the divine envoys

33:34.920 --> 33:36.200
and will face heavenly punishment.

33:37.080 --> 33:37.920
The Sixth Prince, Yue Qin,

33:38.000 --> 33:39.640
is the reincarnation of Sun Kunlun.

33:39.720 --> 33:41.720
The will of heaven cannot be defied!

33:41.800 --> 33:42.960
Nonsense!

33:44.120 --> 33:45.360
I refuse to accept this!

33:50.040 --> 33:52.200
I'm the Second Prince of Xiyan.

33:52.280 --> 33:53.720
Come nearer if you dare.

34:00.760 --> 34:02.640
The Sixth Prince, Yue Qin,

34:03.440 --> 34:04.880
is blessed by the gods.

34:05.720 --> 34:08.440
He shall ascend to the throne of Xiyan.

34:09.719 --> 34:11.800
Long live the King!

34:11.880 --> 34:13.920
The gods have chosen the true heir!

34:14.000 --> 34:15.800
With divine protection,

34:15.880 --> 34:17.719
Xiyan shall flourish for all eternity!

35:04.160 --> 35:07.800
PRINCE HEIR'S MANSION

35:07.880 --> 35:08.720
Mr. Yue Qin…

35:09.320 --> 35:10.360
no, Your Highness,

35:10.440 --> 35:13.120
news of your ascension as Prince Heir
has reached Great Yan.

35:13.720 --> 35:15.480
The princess will hear of it soon.

35:16.640 --> 35:18.040
As per your instructions,

35:18.120 --> 35:19.200
we've transplanted

35:19.280 --> 35:22.400
some Qingzhou crops to the estate.

35:24.640 --> 35:26.640
When Mei Lin moves to Xiyan,

35:27.280 --> 35:29.440
she can tend to these Qingzhou crops

35:30.240 --> 35:31.880
to ease her homesickness.

35:32.640 --> 35:33.960
Farming?

35:34.880 --> 35:37.520
Will Miss Mei Lin enjoy that kind of life?

35:40.880 --> 35:41.920
Madam Wang!

35:42.880 --> 35:43.720
Madam Wang.

35:47.040 --> 35:48.040
The harvest is here!

35:48.120 --> 35:50.840
In a few days,
we'll hold a big feast to celebrate.

35:50.920 --> 35:52.560
There'll be so much delicious food!

35:52.640 --> 35:54.200
Madam, we'll help you out.

35:54.280 --> 35:55.320
Yeah.

35:55.840 --> 35:56.920
You stay here.

35:57.000 --> 35:58.360
The physician said

35:58.440 --> 36:01.160
you were still weak and needed rest.

36:01.240 --> 36:02.560
Your sister's quick and capable.

36:02.640 --> 36:03.920
Her help is enough.

36:04.000 --> 36:05.920
Listen to Madam Wang.
Don't get in the way.

36:07.240 --> 36:08.560
I'll help too.

36:08.640 --> 36:09.760
I'm all better now.

36:09.840 --> 36:10.680
Thank you, Mei Lin.

36:10.760 --> 36:11.840
Wei,

36:12.440 --> 36:13.640
you still have poison in you.

36:13.720 --> 36:16.480
If you don't rest,
you won't do heavy work again.

36:16.560 --> 36:18.840
Without strength,
how will you make a living?

36:18.920 --> 36:20.960
Exactly. Listen to my brother. Just rest.

36:21.920 --> 36:25.120
Enough. You two
will just make things harder.

36:25.200 --> 36:26.840
Mei Lin's help is all I need.

36:27.600 --> 36:28.440
Let's get to work.

36:28.520 --> 36:29.360
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

36:30.920 --> 36:32.640
I'll help once I fully recover, okay?

36:32.720 --> 36:33.560
Just rest.

38:06.800 --> 38:08.400
Mei Lin, let me help you.

38:09.440 --> 38:11.240
It's alright, Wei. I've got it.

38:12.440 --> 38:13.920
It's alright. I can do it.

38:14.000 --> 38:14.880
I'm really fine.

38:14.960 --> 38:16.760
Futian's father said I could work again.

38:16.840 --> 38:18.240
Stop working and go rest.

38:18.320 --> 38:20.280
No worries. Let me help you.

38:29.640 --> 38:30.880
Here, wear my hat.

38:30.960 --> 38:33.480
It's too hot. Put it on.

38:33.560 --> 38:34.880
I don't need it, Wei.

38:34.960 --> 38:36.560
- Just put it on.
- I'm not hot. You wear it.

38:37.160 --> 38:38.040
I really don't need it.

38:38.840 --> 38:39.680
Erniu,

38:41.800 --> 38:43.560
see that big guy up ahead?

38:52.880 --> 38:55.720
Tell the big brother Erniu did it!

38:57.000 --> 38:57.840
Erniu!

38:58.400 --> 39:00.000
I'll beat you up!

39:15.200 --> 39:16.400
Is it pretty?

39:19.640 --> 39:20.600
Here.

39:22.880 --> 39:23.720
Did you make these?

39:27.080 --> 39:28.320
I borrowed them from Erniu's mother.

39:28.920 --> 39:30.680
The crops can be prickly.

39:30.760 --> 39:31.960
Better put them on.

39:41.440 --> 39:42.280
They fit perfectly.

39:50.400 --> 39:52.360
Your brother sure is capable.

39:52.440 --> 39:53.880
He can even do needlework!

39:54.760 --> 39:57.400
Miss, you're such a lucky girl!

40:00.520 --> 40:02.080
My brother sure is capable.

40:07.440 --> 40:09.640
Ergou, let your wife take a break.

40:09.720 --> 40:11.040
Look at her. She's exhausted!

40:18.280 --> 40:20.280
Do it like this. Make a clean cut.

40:20.840 --> 40:21.840
Like this?
